    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26929" root="طلس" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَلِيسٌ</span></b> , of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَعِيلٌ</span> in the sense of the
measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَفْعُولٌ</span>, (assumed tropical:)  <i>Having the eye blinded:</i> in
the O and K erroneously said to be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِلِّيس</span>, like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِكِّيت</span>: but in the Tekmileh, correctly, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَلِيس</span>,
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمِير</span>. (TA.)

